  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ed 1020.03 Classification. An individual who applies for and meets the requirements for classification under Ed 1020.10 shall be qualified as a sign language interpreter by the department’s program for the deaf and hard of hearing.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1, #2, and #3 at chapter heading for Ed 1000) #13231, eff 7-13-21",
